{"uid":"9d2fa94801f71ad0","name":"test_bind_returns_none_for_in_memory_tools","fullName":"tests.test_workflow_runtime#test_bind_returns_none_for_in_memory_tools","historyId":"9bea0f5afcf591ab2ff2d1d10807602d","time":{"start":1786762465219,"stop":1786762465222,"duration":3},"description":"An ``<in-memory>`` binding has no module to load, so it binds to nothing.\n\n    Previously this test also covered an *unimportable* module path and expected the same\n    ``None``. That contract changed when registered tools moved out of process (C8):\n    deciding at bind time whether ``caliber.nope`` imports would mean importing it in the\n    control plane, which is precisely what the sandbox exists to prevent. The unimportable\n    case is now asserted separately, at call time.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>An <code>&lt;in-memory&gt;</code> binding has no module to load, so it binds to nothing.</p>\n<pre><code>Previously this test also covered an *unimportable* module path and expected the same\n``None``. That contract changed when registered tools moved out of process (C8):\ndeciding at bind time whether ``caliber.nope`` imports would mean importing it in the\ncontrol plane, which is precisely what the sandbox exists to prevent. The unimportable\ncase is now asserted separately, at call time.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1786761425423,"stop":1786761425424,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1786762465214,"stop":1786762465214,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_def